mandatory.description:
Every contact in this list is mandatory. The optional lock must be locked if selected.

**Configured alternative groups:** {groups_summary}

Manage groups from Required contacts and groups; do not duplicate group contacts here.

protection.description:
Every required contact must be closed. Every alternative group is required too, but ONE closed contact per group is enough.

**Configured groups:** {groups_summary}

Edit required contacts, add, edit or remove groups here. Changes are blocked while armed.
